This is a leftover from the original upstream monorepo structure. The upstream  1napz/agent-hub  was designed so that  agent-hub  was a package subdirectory within a larger monorepo. But in this fork, the repo IS the agent-hub project — when GitHub Actions checks out the code, it goes to  /home/runner/work/agent-hub/agent-hub/ , and then  working-directory: ./agent-hub  tries to cd into a subfolder named  agent-hub  that doesn't exist.
 
